      "decision_index": 75,
    },
    {
      "severity": "questionable",
      "description": "Casting Last Gasp instead of Danitha Capashen, Paragon. Last Gasp kills a summoning-sick Scion Summoner (or token) for Blood Artist value, but it prevents casting Danitha this turn. Danitha (2/2 first strike, vigilance, lifelink) would start providing life gain, enable cheaper equipment costs, and is a strong board development play. The removed creature was summoning sick and not an immediate threat.",
      "action_taken": "Cast Last Gasp to remove a summoning-sick creature",
