      "decision_index": 85,
    },
    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Failed to block Blood Artist 0/1 with any available creature. Blood Artist is a dangerous engine that triggers on every creature death. Any blocker (Scion Summoner 2/2 or Eldrazi Scion Token 1/1) would have killed the 0/1 Blood Artist while surviving themselves, removing this critical threat at the cost of only one Blood Artist death trigger (1 life loss). Instead, Blood Artist survives to continue generating value from future creature deaths.",
