      "decision_index": 92,
    },
    {
      "severity": "major",
      "description": "Tactic passed priority in the precombat main phase with no creatures on board, facing multiple opposing creatures, while having Kwende castable for exactly 4 mana. Kwende is a key piece enabling the knight synergy package in hand (gives double strike to first strikers like Balan and Danitha). With no land in hand to play, there's no reason to delay. Passing here wastes the entire turn of development.",
      "action_taken": "Passed priority without casting anything, effectively ending the turn with no board presence.",
